; Import library for the `xinput` link name: point it at xinput1_4.dll, which
; every Windows 10/11 PC has (MinGW's own libxinput.a targets the old
; DirectX-2010-runtime xinput1_3.dll, which many PCs lack). MSVC's xinput.lib
; already resolves to xinput1_4.dll, so this only matters for MinGW builds.
LIBRARY xinput1_4.dll
EXPORTS
XInputGetState
XInputGetCapabilities
